# composite4.py rewrites every candidate into the whole 1200x2670 drawer screenshot and crops a
# two-row strip out of it, which is ~4 MB of PNG that regenerates in one command. Kept: the
# contact sheet, and the five per-candidate layers that are small and that somebody may want to
# look at without running anything. Everything the gallery needs is inside gallery.html as data
# URIs, including the drawer strips.
*-drawer.png
*-crop.png
